  "goodToKnow": "Innig means deep, heartfelt or intimate: eine innige Beziehung, Umarmung, Freundschaft, ein inniger Wunsch. Inniglich (fervently) is old-fashioned. It comes from innen (inside), feelings from deep within. Synonyms: herzlich, tief, eng. The opposite is oberflächlich (superficial). The comparative is inniger."
